om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
fn argargs va view ulong 5 sc view uint 2 y edit uint * to ulong
if lt len y 8
ret 1
end
for i ulong len y
put y i 0
end
for i ulong 3
put y mul i 2 uint get va i
put y add mul i 2 1 uint shr get va i 32
end
put y 6 get sc 0
put y 7 get sc 1
if ge len y 12
for i ulong 2
v = get va add i 3
put y add 8 mul i 2 uint v
put y add 9 mul i 2 uint shr v 32
end
end
ret 0
end
